body:
Well, it's exactly the same schema as above and I merely bake the project (I just did it again, using the same schema, to confirm).

The `UsersController` has this as view-action:

```
   public function view($id = null) {
       $user = $this->Users->get($id, [
           'contain' => ['Projects', 'ProjectsUsers']
       ]);
       $this->set('user', $user);
   }
```

Maybe this has to do with the type of key used on the join-table?

Seriously, it's not a big deal - but may throw someone off who's getting started with baking. ;-)
